Giorgi (13 Oct): every case title in the three tabs is a long sentence that
does not fit; the design wants two or three words on a desktop and one on a
phone. Migration 239 adds threads.short_title and one_word_title; after the
title is written, the same cheap model shortens it into both, they are
stored, broadcast with thread_updated and listed in GET /threads. A new
title clears them. The prompt is model-facing (D44) and waits for Misho's
yes, so SHORT_TITLES_ON is false and nothing is written yet.

